{"3024120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eletta", "steam_appid": 3024120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eletta is a mischievous action-adventure where the environment isn’t just decoration; it’s your arsenal. Outwit enemies with hilariously devious traps and turn everyday objects into disaster machines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE IS JUST THE BEGINNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kidnapped and trapped, Eletta only wants one thing... is to find a way out. While trying to escape captivity, she uncovers the truth behind why she was taken and realizes she’s the only one that can do something about it before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024120/extras/8e200e7ae19520491e80859d438260a1.poster.avif?t=1782950073\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024120/extras/8e200e7ae19520491e80859d438260a1.webm?t=1782950073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024120/extras/8e200e7ae19520491e80859d438260a1.mp4?t=1782950073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPROVISED COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this lighthearted yet darkly thrilling adventure, you play as Eletta, a sharp-witted girl determined to escape her captors using whatever she can get her hands on. From improvised traps to sneaky distractions, the environment is your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024120/extras/596616cc701055ece633ca207384a704.poster.avif?t=1782950073\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024120/extras/596616cc701055ece633ca207384a704.webm?t=1782950073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024120/extras/596616cc701055ece633ca207384a704.mp4?t=1782950073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TURN THE TABLES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Weaponize the World: Use the world itself as a weapon and trigger environmental hazards to take down foes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unravel the Mystery: Learn the reason behind your kidnapping and stop it from happening to someone else</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lighthearted Mischief: Laugh at the absurdity, then wince just a little</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Adaptive Enemies: Different foes keep you on your toes, forcing you into a more inventive approach</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mighty Bosses: Face unique bosses that demand creativity and ingenuity</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eletta is a mischievous action-adventure where the environment isn’t just decoration; it’s your arsenal. Outwit enemies with hilariously devious traps and turn everyday objects into disaster machines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE IS JUST THE BEGINNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kidnapped and trapped, Eletta only wants one thing... is to find a way out. While trying to escape captivity, she uncovers the truth behind why she was taken and realizes she’s the only one that can do something about it before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024120/extras/8e200e7ae19520491e80859d438260a1.poster.avif?t=1782950073\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024120/extras/8e200e7ae19520491e80859d438260a1.webm?t=1782950073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024120/extras/8e200e7ae19520491e80859d438260a1.mp4?t=1782950073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPROVISED COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this lighthearted yet darkly thrilling adventure, you play as Eletta, a sharp-witted girl determined to escape her captors using whatever she can get her hands on. From improvised traps to sneaky distractions, the environment is your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024120/extras/596616cc701055ece633ca207384a704.poster.avif?t=1782950073\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024120/extras/596616cc701055ece633ca207384a704.webm?t=1782950073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024120/extras/596616cc701055ece633ca207384a704.mp4?t=1782950073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TURN THE TABLES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Weaponize the World: Use the world itself as a weapon and trigger environmental hazards to take down foes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unravel the Mystery: Learn the reason behind your kidnapping and stop it from happening to someone else</